    "detailed_description": "TurtleQuest is a 2D-Platformer where you are sent on a quest to save your little turtle village from an unknown disease.<br>You have to follow an ancient path through the old mountains to find the sacred plant Zingiber, which might help to cure all turtles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Play As Seni</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/1a06cecf1a0bcd3d1a3a1b22963715d8.poster.avif?t=1694356832\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/1a06cecf1a0bcd3d1a3a1b22963715d8.apng?t=1694356832\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>As you follow the path, you hike through various kinds of levels with hidden traps, natural obstacles, and bewitched things.<br><br>TurtleQuest is inspired by games like &quot;TrapAdventure&quot;, &quot;Cat Mario&quot;, &quot;I Wanna Be The Guy&quot;, so it is quite difficult but in a cute look.<br><br>As of now does TurtleQuest only have 7 levels, I am going on summer vacation, and if enough people are interested in the game, will try and make many more.<br>So please tell your friends about this game, if you liked it, or if you want to see how they manage to beat each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/d81c90538f7454b1efd4b9a751e76eaf.avif?t=1694356832\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/71e6e0133ffd7d46e30d8690ea41fbe9.avif?t=1694356832\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/5d799c4bcda56b76c8a8c11626f51efc.webp?t=1694356832\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "TurtleQuest is a 2D-Platformer where you are sent on a quest to save your little turtle village from an unknown disease.<br>You have to follow an ancient path through the old mountains to find the sacred plant Zingiber, which might help to cure all turtles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Play As Seni</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/1a06cecf1a0bcd3d1a3a1b22963715d8.poster.avif?t=1694356832\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/1a06cecf1a0bcd3d1a3a1b22963715d8.apng?t=1694356832\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>As you follow the path, you hike through various kinds of levels with hidden traps, natural obstacles, and bewitched things.<br><br>TurtleQuest is inspired by games like &quot;TrapAdventure&quot;, &quot;Cat Mario&quot;, &quot;I Wanna Be The Guy&quot;, so it is quite difficult but in a cute look.<br><br>As of now does TurtleQuest only have 7 levels, I am going on summer vacation, and if enough people are interested in the game, will try and make many more.<br>So please tell your friends about this game, if you liked it, or if you want to see how they manage to beat each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/d81c90538f7454b1efd4b9a751e76eaf.avif?t=1694356832\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/71e6e0133ffd7d46e30d8690ea41fbe9.avif?t=1694356832\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479140/extras/5d799c4bcda56b76c8a8c11626f51efc.webp?t=1694356832\" /></span>",
